WEBVTT

NOTE
Screen capture with no audio track. These captions describe what is shown
on screen (accessibility + indexing of the video content).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
3D view of the semantic cocoon: each node is a page, each edge a weighted internal link.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Node colours match the page type: pillar, satellite, category, conversion or technical page.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Node size reflects the page's organic traffic; the pulse shows its recent trend.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Rotating the graph: thematic clusters emerge naturally, separated by semantic distance.

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Selecting a node: the panel shows the page intent, inbound and outbound links and predicted ROI.

6
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Cannibalising pairs are highlighted: two pages targeting one intent replace each other in the SERP.

7
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:26.000
X-Ray mode isolates link juice flow: gold for descending links, purple for links back to the pillar.

8
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:41.208
Linking prescriptions then deploy in one click to the connected CMS, with the anchor suggested by the engine.
